        {
          "id": 1101158502,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "The next available WTAP_ENCAP_ value is 219, so that's what `WTAP_ENCAP_AUERSWALD_LOG` should use.  (Please note that WTAP_ENCAP_ values are ***NOT*** pcap/pcapng LINKTYPE_ values!  Not all WTAP_ENCAP_ values correspond to LINKTYPE_ values, and not all LINKTYPE_ values have corresponding WTAP_ENCAP_ values.)",
